Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Rebirth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 50
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.27,0:00:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.20,0:00:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re here to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.52,0:00:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.72,0:00:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a good thing Sparky is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But how did he end up coming along?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.61,0:00:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ve reached an agreement
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.32,0:00:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,to save this world together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.80,0:00:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But is there really another way?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.88,0:00:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to find another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.92,0:00:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If all the universe’s energy is drained away,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.79,0:01:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,your world will vanish too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.79,0:01:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, how can we help them?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.50,0:01:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The black hole, the energy, and the restorative flower…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.20,0:01:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,These are definitely connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.32,0:01:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s gather the fragments first,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.44,0:01:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and then find the answers within the energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.67,0:01:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree; I’m willing to give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.80,0:01:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.64,0:01:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Only temporarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.80,0:01:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the fragments I have on hand right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.07,0:01:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And the fragments I obtained ended up with Weslie and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.59,0:01:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The only ones left are the fragments I previously retrieved in Green Green Grassland.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.66,0:01:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I sent Green to Green Green Grassland to snatch those fragments.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.06,0:01:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This place looks just like home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.26,0:01:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.98,0:02:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing beats the air of the grassland.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.06,0:02:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Who left this trash here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.72,0:02:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn’t this Mr. Slowy’s drone?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.71,0:02:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.51,0:02:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.26,0:02:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolnie!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.46,0:02:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, you really came back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.98,0:02:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My Wolnie!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.30,0:02:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.30,0:02:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Son!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.72,0:02:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, you’ve become all soft and squishy—super cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.91,0:02:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to Goats’ Village, Wolnie? Where is everyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.18,0:02:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s safe now; everyone can come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.26,0:03:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, Wolffy—you’re finally back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.02,0:03:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Planie, what’s wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.91,0:03:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.47,0:03:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.79,0:03:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I failed to protect the fragment you worked so hard to retrieve.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.30,0:03:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi, you’re back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.98,0:03:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand over the fragment—now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.98,0:03:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi, what’s wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.30,0:03:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He…he isn’t Paddi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.51,0:03:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s the one who destroyed this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.86,0:03:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We could have caught him…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.60,0:04:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I promised Paddi
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.04,0:04:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,that I would protect the grassland fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.11,0:04:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you really bring yourself to hurt me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.27,0:04:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.03,0:04:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m worried something has happened to Paddi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.19,0:04:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys go find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.23,0:04:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll figure out the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.99,0:04:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ve done a great job.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.83,0:04:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to go with you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.90,0:04:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re injured; you should stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.58,0:04:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You…you are me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.84,0:04:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.23,0:04:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s me, Weslie, Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.43,0:04:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.23,0:04:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you turn into a monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.39,0:04:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.74,0:04:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Peach has reached an agreement with us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.09,0:04:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and bring the fragments you have to meet us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.65,0:04:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But the fragment from Goats’ Village was taken by the green Paddi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.44,0:04:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.49,0:05:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Just bring the fragments you retrieved from the other world for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.09,0:05:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.93,0:05:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolnie, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.04,0:05:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead; we’ll be waiting for your return.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.14,0:05:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back soon, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.22,0:05:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, I will personally get my world back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.41,0:05:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy named Green should be on his way back by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.85,0:05:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But we can’t let Green find out about our collaboration.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.20,0:05:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He only takes orders from Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.80,0:05:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And who is Blue?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.12,0:05:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue is our captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.88,0:05:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He was shattered into fragments along with the cosmic energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.05,0:05:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If all the fragments are put back together,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.04,0:05:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,he will be resurrected.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.20,0:05:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He was the one who proposed this plan to absorb the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.60,0:05:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Why were the two of us assigned to guard the fragments alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.88,0:06:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The fragments hold immense power, so there was a fear someone might try to steal them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.40,0:06:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Then picking me to guard them was the right move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.32,0:06:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But why can’t they discuss it here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.92,0:06:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue’s consciousness is still preserved within the fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.40,0:06:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If we talk about him near the fragment,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.84,0:06:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,he’ll hear us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.20,0:06:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That Blue…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.20,0:06:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Can’t we even mention him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.80,0:06:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s so stingy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.30,0:06:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of person was Blue, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.21,0:06:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,In my memories…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.81,0:06:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Failed again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.89,0:06:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.41,0:06:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What conviction kept you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.73,0:06:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was on the verge of fading away,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.61,0:06:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,it was everyone offering their energy to me that saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.40,0:06:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My life was given to me by the villagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.30,0:06:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I carry the hopes of the entire village on my shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.70,0:06:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s why I absolutely cannot give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.82,0:06:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t be fooled by him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.05,0:06:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought the same thing about him at first, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.34,0:06:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But later, I saw another side of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.42,0:07:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do to my flower?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.06,0:07:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That flower simply dissipated on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.69,0:07:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve always felt that he was hiding something from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.22,0:07:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that after we get back the fragments held by Weslie and Green,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.82,0:07:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,we’ll need to give the next steps some serious thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.82,0:07:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We absolutely mustn’t let Green hear this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.89,0:07:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, he definitely won’t hand over the fragments.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.82,0:07:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.89,0:07:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No point in talking—hand over your fragments now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.28,0:07:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re the one who needs to hand over the fragments.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.07,0:07:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Planie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.48,0:08:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of Paddi’s body right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.84,0:08:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.03,0:08:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t waste your effort; there’s no way he’ll wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.85,0:08:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.36,0:08:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you can’t bring yourselves to do it,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.12,0:08:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll be the one to snap him out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.47,0:08:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Planie stop
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.75,0:08:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s Paddi’s body
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.43,0:08:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,To save my world
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.28,0:09:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me back the fragment
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.32,0:09:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll be back. Just wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.25,0:09:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally got the fragment back
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.25,0:09:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Planie with the multicolored fragments is so awesome
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.97,0:09:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Go and give it to Mr. Slowy
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.24,0:09:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You actually got the fragment in Green’s hand back
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.64,0:09:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, what about other fragments?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.84,0:09:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,in another room
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.23,0:09:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Paper Beast will take you there
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.04,0:09:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I’ll send the fragments over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.12,0:09:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember not to put the fragments together
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.12,0:09:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.73,0:09:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Not good
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.65,0:09:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Last time I saw him holding the fragment, I heard Blue’s voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.17,0:09:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Brown is watching over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.45,0:09:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go over and have a look
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.68,0:09:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you finally realized our importance?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.04,0:09:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what problem you want to solve by calling us here
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.85,0:09:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn’t ask you to come over
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.25,0:09:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn’t Planie just say
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.56,0:10:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Something must have happened over there. Let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.84,0:10:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.16,0:10:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I have something to give you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.63,0:10:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I’d be back
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.83,0:10:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me the fragments quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.65,0:10:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming, this is my power
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.04,0:10:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Then don’t blame me for being rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.32,0:10:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember not to put the fragments together
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.27,0:10:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me all the energy
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.71,0:10:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,to protect my world
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.24,0:10:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve been waiting for this moment
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.83,0:10:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m not that useless Planie anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.23,0:10:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the hero who saves the world
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.03,0:11:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it really what you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.96,0:11:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,what
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.75,0:11:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this force strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.27,0:11:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,what’s going on
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.87,0:11:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn’t you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.82,0:11:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.63,0:11:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If you weren’t useful to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.51,0:11:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,a useless supporting character like you—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.43,0:11:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn’t even give you a second glance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.23,0:11:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn’t you come to me because of my potential and ability?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.10,0:11:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Potential?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.71,0:11:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked Green to lose to you on purpose
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.47,0:11:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and give you the fragment
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.66,0:11:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, I can use you to evade everyone’s suspicion
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.51,0:11:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and combine all fragments.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.43,0:11:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Why did you use me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.14,0:11:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would have thought that an insignificant, useless supporting character like you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.26,0:11:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,would turn out to be the most crucial move in my plan for resurrection?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.02,0:11:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I really am such a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.62,0:12:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m back
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.34,0:12:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We meet again
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
